From 134aa5e22acdf4c3362eaee8239b6acaf698f90b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Aug 2024 19:20:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Enforce strict chain ID on nVersion (#35)

(cherry picked from commit 3afd1a4d3a93e17faabc1f87414e6e4ddbfad87c)

Maintenance rationale (2026-10-14):
Reject non-legacy headers with a foreign chain ID where the network requires strict Dogecoin chain identification.

